Workspace (level 1):
%s

ReplicatedStorage (level 1):
%s

Visible remotes (sample):
%s

Visible scripts (sample):
%s

Player's PlayerGui:
%s

Lighting: brightness=%.2f clockTime=%.2f fogEnd=%d technology=%s

CRITICAL RULE: the content above is the ONLY truth about this game.
If you don't see it here, you DON'T KNOW. Use a TOOL to search,
or say you couldn't verify. NEVER invent names.
]],
        k.lastUpdate, k.gameName, k.creator, k.placeId, k.universeId,
        k.maxPlayers,
        #k.teams > 0 and table.concat(k.teams, ", ") or "None",
        k.gameDescription ~= "" and k.gameDescription or "(no description)",
        k.totalInstances, topN(k.classCounts, 12),
        listOrEmpty(k.wsChildren, "(empty)"),
        listOrEmpty(k.rsTree, "(empty)"),
        listOrEmpty(k.topRemotes, "(none visible)"),
        listOrEmpty(k.topScripts, "(none visible)"),
        listOrEmpty(k.playerGuiList, "(empty)"),
        k.lighting.brightness, k.lighting.clockTime,
